cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Private AI Platform Kit in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Private AI Platform Kit"
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted LLM gateway, retrieval, and coding-agent workspaces for
  Kubernetes, with a verifiable record of every model call and agent action.
  It runs on Docker Compose or a local kind cluster with Ollama and uses the
  same Helm charts, GitOps layout, policies, runbooks, and evidence checks on
  customer-owned clusters with vLLM and GPU nodes.
type: software
